     "<div><div style=\"width:576px\"><p>Hello all,<p>Thanks for a great first year of D-RUG!  I&#39;d like to hear what has worked and what hasn&#39;t from all of you so as to make D-RUG more useful to more people next year.  Please fill out this short survey so I can incorporate your feedback.  <p>Please note that you can fill out the survey even if you&#39;ve never attended a D-RUG session.  In fact, I&#39;d especially like to hear from those that haven&#39;t.<p>Cheers,<p>Noam</p></p></p></p></p>\r\nIf you have trouble viewing or submitting this form, you can fill it out online:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1P4YpbEPiRgP9mwoHXtqHS5cewHz2GgwjRRZBvcE3BBE/viewform\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1P4YpbEPiRgP9mwoHXtqHS5cewHz2GgwjRRZBvcE3BBE/viewform&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792469542402000&amp;usg=AOvVaw24C6qiYwaS5xgOWC57c7PQ\">https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1P4YpbEPiRgP9mwoHXtqHS5cewHz2GgwjRRZBvcE3BBE/viewform</a>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><h1 dir=\"ltr\">Quick Survey: D-RUG Year 1</h1></div>\r\n<div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;display:inline\">\r\n</div>\r\n<div><div><form action=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1P4YpbEPiRgP9mwoHXtqHS5cewHz2GgwjRRZBvcE3BBE/formResponse\" method=\"POST\" target=\"_blank\"><ol style=\"padding-left:0\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"max-width:100%\"><label><div style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold\">Which is the most useful thing to you about D-RUG?\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:block;margin:.1em 0 .25em 0;color:#666\">Please rank your choices</div></label>\r\n<div>\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\"><thead><tr><td style=\"text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid #d3d8d3;min-width:100px;max-width:200px;padding-left:15px\"></td>\r\n<td style=\"width:20%;text-align:center;border-bottom:1px solid #d3d8d3\"><label style=\"display:block;padding:0.5em 0 .5em\">Help over e-mail</label></td> <td style=\"width:20%;text-align:center;border-bottom:1px solid #d3d8d3\"><label style=\"display:block;padding:0.5em 0 .5em\">Help at work sessions</label></td> <td style=\"width:20%;text-align:center;border-bottom:1px solid #d3d8d3\"><label style=\"display:block;padding:0.5em 0 .5em\">Speaker presentations</label></td> <td style=\"width:20%;text-align:center;border-bottom:1px solid #d3d8d3\"><label style=\"display:block;padding:0.5em 0 .5em\">Speaker notes posted online</label></td></tr></thead>\r\n<tbody><tr style=\"text-align:center;color:#666;border-bottom:1px solid #d3d8d3;padding:.5em .25em;background-color:#f2f2f2\"><td style=\"text-align:left;color:#666;border-bottom:1px solid #d3d8d3;padding:.5em .25em;min-width:100px;max-width:200px;padding-left:15px\">1. Most useful</td>\r\n<td style=\"width:20%;text-align:center;color:#666;border-bottom:1px solid #d3d8d3;padding:.5em .25em\"><div><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.1406132529\" value=\"Help over e-mail\"></div></td> <td style=\"width:20%;text-align:center;color:#666;border-bottom:1px solid #d3d8d3;padding:.5em .25em\"><div><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.1406132529\" value=\"Help at work sessions\"></div></td> <td style=\"width:20%;text-align:center;color:#666;border-bottom:1px solid #d3d8d3;padding:.5em .25em\"><div><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.1406132529\" value=\"Speaker presentations\"></div></td> <td style=\"width:20%;text-align:center;color:#666;border-bottom:1px solid #d3d8d3;padding:.5em .25em\"><div><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.1406132529\" value=\"Speaker notes posted online\"></div></td></tr> <tr style=\"text-align:center;color:#666;border-bottom:1px solid #d3d8d3;padding:.5em .25em;background-color:#fff\"><td style=\"text-align:left;color:#666;border-bottom:1px solid #d3d8d3;padding:.5em .25em;min-width:100px;max-width:200px;padding-left:15px\">2.</td>\r\n<td style=\"width:20%;text-align:center;color:#666;border-bottom:1px solid #d3d8d3;padding:.5em .25em\"><div><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.1175347102\" value=\"Help over e-mail\"></div></td> <td style=\"width:20%;text-align:center;color:#666;border-bottom:1px solid #d3d8d3;padding:.5em .25em\"><div><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.1175347102\" value=\"Help at work sessions\"></div></td> <td style=\"width:20%;text-align:center;color:#666;border-bottom:1px solid #d3d8d3;padding:.5em .25em\"><div><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.1175347102\" value=\"Speaker presentations\"></div></td> <td style=\"width:20%;text-align:center;color:#666;border-bottom:1px solid #d3d8d3;padding:.5em .25em\"><div><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.1175347102\" value=\"Speaker notes posted online\"></div></td></tr> <tr style=\"text-align:center;color:#666;border-bottom:1px solid #d3d8d3;padding:.5em .25em;background-color:#f2f2f2\"><td style=\"text-align:left;color:#666;border-bottom:1px solid #d3d8d3;padding:.5em .25em;min-width:100px;max-width:200px;padding-left:15px\">3.</td>\r\n<td style=\"width:20%;text-align:center;color:#666;border-bottom:1px solid #d3d8d3;padding:.5em .25em\"><div><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.1459364266\" value=\"Help over e-mail\"></div></td> <td style=\"width:20%;text-align:center;color:#666;border-bottom:1px solid #d3d8d3;padding:.5em .25em\"><div><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.1459364266\" value=\"Help at work sessions\"></div></td> <td style=\"width:20%;text-align:center;color:#666;border-bottom:1px solid #d3d8d3;padding:.5em .25em\"><div><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.1459364266\" value=\"Speaker presentations\"></div></td> <td style=\"width:20%;text-align:center;color:#666;border-bottom:1px solid #d3d8d3;padding:.5em .25em\"><div><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.1459364266\" value=\"Speaker notes posted online\"></div></td></tr> <tr style=\"text-align:center;color:#666;border-bottom:1px solid #d3d8d3;padding:.5em .25em;background-color:#fff\"><td style=\"text-align:left;color:#666;border-bottom:1px solid #d3d8d3;padding:.5em .25em;min-width:100px;max-width:200px;padding-left:15px\">4. Least useful</td>\r\n<td style=\"width:20%;text-align:center;color:#666;border-bottom:1px solid #d3d8d3;padding:.5em .25em\"><div><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.597630481\" value=\"Help over e-mail\"></div></td> <td style=\"width:20%;text-align:center;color:#666;border-bottom:1px solid #d3d8d3;padding:.5em .25em\"><div><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.597630481\" value=\"Help at work sessions\"></div></td> <td style=\"width:20%;text-align:center;color:#666;border-bottom:1px solid #d3d8d3;padding:.5em .25em\"><div><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.597630481\" value=\"Speaker presentations\"></div></td> <td style=\"width:20%;text-align:center;color:#666;border-bottom:1px solid #d3d8d3;padding:.5em .25em\"><div><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.597630481\" value=\"Speaker notes posted online\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\r\n</div></div></div> <div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin:12px 0\"><div style=\"max-width:100%\"><label><div style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold\">When I come to D-RUG work sessions, it&#39;s most commonly because \r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:block;margin:.1em 0 .25em 0;color:#666\">Note: Hitting &quot;enter&quot; after typing in the &quot;other&quot; box will submit the form</div></label>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"list-style:none;margin:.5em 0 0 0;padding:0\"><li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.1931103162\" value=\"The speaker/topic is useful to me\"></span>\r\n<span>The speaker/topic is useful to me</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.1931103162\" value=\"I want to learn more about R in general\"></span>\r\n<span>I want to learn more about R in general</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.1931103162\" value=\"I can get help on a problem that I have\"></span>\r\n<span>I can get help on a problem that I have</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.1931103162\" value=\"I like working in a group environment\"></span>\r\n<span>I like working in a group environment</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.1931103162\" value=\"__other_option__\"></span>\r\nOther:</label>\r\n<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"text\" name=\"entry.1931103162.other_option_response\" value=\"\" dir=\"auto\"></span></li></ul>\r\n</div></div></div> <div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin:12px 0\"><div style=\"max-width:100%\"><label><div style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold\">When I don&#39;t come to D-RUG sessions, it&#39;s commonly because\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:block;margin:.1em 0 .25em 0;color:#666\">Note: Hitting &quot;enter&quot; after typing in the &quot;other&quot; box will submit the form</div></label>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"list-style:none;margin:.5em 0 0 0;padding:0\"><li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.1661846088\" value=\"I have a schedule conflict\"></span>\r\n<span>I have a schedule conflict</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.1661846088\" value=\"It&#39;s too much time\"></span>\r\n<span>It&#39;s too much time</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.1661846088\" value=\"The topics don&#39;t interest me\"></span>\r\n<span>The topics don&#39;t interest me</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.1661846088\" value=\"I don&#39;t get the kind of help I need\"></span>\r\n<span>I don&#39;t get the kind of help I need</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.1661846088\" value=\"__other_option__\"></span>\r\nOther:</label>\r\n<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"text\" name=\"entry.1661846088.other_option_response\" value=\"\" dir=\"auto\"></span></li></ul>\r\n</div></div></div> <div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin:12px 0\"><div style=\"max-width:100%\"><label><div style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold\">I make use of the code from D-RUG that is posted online\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:block;margin:.1em 0 .25em 0;color:#666\"></div></label>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"list-style:none;margin:.5em 0 0 0;padding:0\"><li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.740098831\" value=\"A lot\"></span>\r\n<span>A lot</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.740098831\" value=\"A little\"></span>\r\n<span>A little</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.740098831\" value=\"Not at all\"></span>\r\n<span>Not at all</span>\r\n</label></li></ul>\r\n</div></div></div> <div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin:12px 0\"><div style=\"max-width:100%\"><label><div style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold\">The level of sophistication of talks at D-RUG is\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:block;margin:.1em 0 .25em 0;color:#666\"></div></label>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"list-style:none;margin:.5em 0 0 0;padding:0\"><li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.1634362074\" value=\"Too simple\"></span>\r\n<span>Too simple</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.1634362074\" value=\"Too complex\"></span>\r\n<span>Too complex</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.1634362074\" value=\"Just right\"></span>\r\n<span>Just right</span>\r\n</label></li></ul>\r\n</div></div></div> <div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin:12px 0\"><div style=\"max-width:100%\"><label><div style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold\">E-mail traffic on the D-RUG list is fairly low. Which of these is the most likely reason you DO NOT ask a question on the D-RUG list?\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:block;margin:.1em 0 .25em 0;color:#666\">Note: Hitting &quot;enter&quot; after typing in the &quot;other&quot; box will submit the form</div></label>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"list-style:none;margin:.5em 0 0 0;padding:0\"><li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.1474307981\" value=\"I can usually find what I need without asking for help\"></span>\r\n<span>I can usually find what I need without asking for help</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.1474307981\" value=\"I find help in a different forum online (R-help, StackOverflow, etc.)\"></span>\r\n<span>I find help in a different forum online (R-help, StackOverflow, etc.)</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.1474307981\" value=\"I don&#39;t know how to phrase the question/it&#39;s too complex for e-mail\"></span>\r\n<span>I don&#39;t know how to phrase the question/it&#39;s too complex for e-mail</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.1474307981\" value=\"I don&#39;t want to ask the question on a public e-mail list\"></span>\r\n<span>I don&#39;t want to ask the question on a public e-mail list</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.1474307981\" value=\"It doesn&#39;t occur to me\"></span>\r\n<span>It doesn&#39;t occur to me</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.1474307981\" value=\"__other_option__\"></span>\r\nOther:</label>\r\n<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"text\" name=\"entry.1474307981.other_option_response\" value=\"\" dir=\"auto\"></span></li></ul>\r\n</div></div></div> <div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin:12px 0\"><div style=\"max-width:100%\"><label><div style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold\">The thing that would make D-RUG more useful to me is\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:block;margin:.1em 0 .25em 0;color:#666\"></div></label>\r\n<textarea name=\"entry.1686567992\" rows=\"8\" cols=\"0\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"width:70%\"></textarea>\r\n\r\n</div></div></div> <div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin:12px 0\"><div style=\"max-width:100%\"><label><div style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold\">A